cff-version: 1.2.0
title: JoyCaption Batch Captioner for Runpod Serverless
message: If you use this worker, please cite it, upstream JoyCaption, and Llama 3.1.
type: software
authors:
  - name: prilojject
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/prilojject/runpod-joycaption
url: https://prilojject.github.io/runpod-joycaption/
abstract: >-
  A Runpod Serverless worker that batch-captions images for LoRA / diffusion
  datasets with official JoyCaption Beta One (bf16, sidecar .txt + captions.json).
  Built with Llama.
keywords:
  - joycaption
  - image-captioning
  - lora
  - runpod
  - serverless
  - llama
references:
